# 1. Introduction

Provide a short description of the software being specified. Describe its purpose, including relevant benefits, objectives, and goals.

To provide a user friendly interface for students and faculty to find and promote job vacancies for the upcoming year autonomously. Students will enter contact information and course preferences which will automatically enter them for job listings and intructors can choose from a generated list of applicants who are interested in their course. 

